{"4266820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steam & Glory", "steam_appid": 4266820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hybrid Arcade / Simulation Train Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a 20-ton steam train and pilot it successfully to the goal in this new arcade / simulation hybrid game from ROBYSOFT! Inspired heavily by Japanese train simulators such as Densha de Go!, Steam &amp; Glory takes the action out west. Not only must you arrive on time and stop on a dime at the station, but you'll have to race to evade bandits, dodge wagon crossings, pick up bonus gold and keep your rig from flying off the track or bursting into flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control your Rig the Right Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unofficially compatible the ZUIKI Mascon train controller, you will feel the full-weight of your payload as you use the extra clicky and granular throttle and brake lever to fine tune your train's speed around twisty canyon turns, up challenging hill climbs, and across snowy plateaus to complete your mission on-time and intact. Steam &amp; Glory is also playable with Xbox-style gamepads and keyboard. (Note: ZUIKI Mascon controller is the property of ZUIKI and no official endorsement or claims of compatibility from ZUIKI is implied.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=780 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soak in the Old West</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam &amp; Glory features a variety of missions across classic old west landscapes presented with a nostalgic PS1-era aesthetic, and a sweeping western soundtrack from D.D. Curry. Earn increasing ranks for the excellence of your performance. Can you best your rivals and achieve the rank of Top Steamer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/be0a267309fe25a28993f6633302429f.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hybrid Arcade / Simulation Train Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a 20-ton steam train and pilot it successfully to the goal in this new arcade / simulation hybrid game from ROBYSOFT! Inspired heavily by Japanese train simulators such as Densha de Go!, Steam &amp; Glory takes the action out west. Not only must you arrive on time and stop on a dime at the station, but you'll have to race to evade bandits, dodge wagon crossings, pick up bonus gold and keep your rig from flying off the track or bursting into flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/1be6708f1a765dae241189bb0172e7db.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control your Rig the Right Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unofficially compatible the ZUIKI Mascon train controller, you will feel the full-weight of your payload as you use the extra clicky and granular throttle and brake lever to fine tune your train's speed around twisty canyon turns, up challenging hill climbs, and across snowy plateaus to complete your mission on-time and intact. Steam &amp; Glory is also playable with Xbox-style gamepads and keyboard. (Note: ZUIKI Mascon controller is the property of ZUIKI and no official endorsement or claims of compatibility from ZUIKI is implied.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=780 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/e03d7625528fe5a03705f95537054483.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soak in the Old West</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam &amp; Glory features a variety of missions across classic old west landscapes presented with a nostalgic PS1-era aesthetic, and a sweeping western soundtrack from D.D. Curry. Earn increasing ranks for the excellence of your performance. Can you best your rivals and achieve the rank of Top Steamer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.poster.avif?t=1781208056\" width=760 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.webm?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/extras/64779af785aa77fa203fdc0f10e24375.mp4?t=1781208056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Steam &amp; Glory is a hybrid arcade/simulation train game where you take control of a 20-ton steam train as you steam, brake, ring your bell and blow your whistle to power through to the goal! Take in the scenic old west views as you race to get to the station on time!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/b828953b23fe1902452e6b4975b94fe11c8c3f9f/header.jpg?t=1781208056", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/9e3967c621ab8a9a519299dece3f955b38e40a1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781208056", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266820/9e3967c621ab8a9a519299dece3f955b38e40a1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781208056", "website": "http://steamandglory.robysoft.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 or equivalent (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best played with Zuiki Mascon Train Controller</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580 or equivalent (4GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best played with Zuiki Mascon Train Controller</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["ROBYSOFT"], "publishers": ["ROBYSOFT"], "demos": [{"appid": 4639080, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "d